(3516953, 491055, 65025, '<td valign="top">The backlighting really adds a nice definition to the arms and armpit hair.  The expression is also nice.  The one thing I might have changed if I were you is that thing in the lower right corner.  It kind of distracts.  8</td>', 'The backlighting really adds a nice definition to the arms and armpit hair.  The expression is also nice.  The one thing I might have changed if I were you is that thing in the lower right corner.  It kind of distracts.  8', '2007-04-04 01:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3516996, 491860, 20462, '<td valign="top">I lovvvve this.  Where?</td>', 'I lovvvve this.  Where?', '2007-04-04 01:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517056, 491193, 65025, '<td valign="top">That''s a really cool macro shot.  I like the color and the detail of the water droplets.  You might try resizing it larger though.</td>', 'That''s a really cool macro shot.  I like the color and the detail of the water droplets.  You might try resizing it larger though.', '2007-04-04 01:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517062, 492570, 65025, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  Nice contrasting color between the water and the yellow and red.  I would love to see this in advanced editing with the person lightened.  8..edit: bumped up to 9<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-11 13:40:51.</i></td>', 'Beautiful photo.  Nice contrasting color between the water and the yellow and red.  I would love to see this in advanced editing with the person lightened.  8..edit: bumped up to 9', '2007-04-04 01:46:08.000000', '2007-04-11 14:40:51.000000', 1),
(3517072, 492502, 65025, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shadow and color.  It would be cool to see the guy lifting more and with an expression as if he is giving it all he has.</td>', 'Nice use of shadow and color.  It would be cool to see the guy lifting more and with an expression as if he is giving it all he has.', '2007-04-04 01:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517080, 491209, 65025, '<td valign="top">Great vantage point.  It''s cool how the rock on the right bottom is blurry and larger...it adds depth.  The placement of the subject is also nice.  The only thing I wish is that the subjects face, or at least more of a profile, was showing. 8</td>', 'Great vantage point.  It''s cool how the rock on the right bottom is blurry and larger...it adds depth.  The placement of the subject is also nice.  The only thing I wish is that the subjects face, or at least more of a profile, was showing. 8', '2007-04-04 01:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517082, 492586, 65025, '<td valign="top">You captured a great expression and position of the subject.  It''s very candid and also a great extreme sports shot.</td>', 'You captured a great expression and position of the subject.  It''s very candid and also a great extreme sports shot.', '2007-04-04 01:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517088, 490048, 65025, '<td valign="top">Great texture.</td>', 'Great texture.', '2007-04-04 01:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517094, 492434, 65025, '<td valign="top">That''s a lovely sky and a nice use of silhouette.  I wish I could see more of the silhouette though.  If you got lower to the ground her leggs would have been silhouetted as well probably.</td>', 'That''s a lovely sky and a nice use of silhouette.  I wish I could see more of the silhouette though.  If you got lower to the ground her leggs would have been silhouetted as well probably.', '2007-04-04 01:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517098, 490248, 65025, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic lighting and also dirty texture on the ball.</td>', 'Nice dramatic lighting and also dirty texture on the ball.', '2007-04-04 01:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517114, 491860, 65025, '<td valign="top">sweet sweet shot...It''s very different from the normal closeup shot you always see in sports.  It''s an amazing scene mixed with a great action shot.  You picked the perfect moment to capture the boarder.  He or she is in the clouds, so the simple background of the sky works better than the city.  It''s also nice that you included the jump (or whatever the termonology is) in there.  It adds a lot compared to cropping that out.  The photographers at the bottom also add a nice touch.  This seems kind of photojournalistic.</td>', 'sweet sweet shot...It''s very different from the normal closeup shot you always see in sports.  It''s an amazing scene mixed with a great action shot.  You picked the perfect moment to capture the boarder.  He or she is in the clouds, so the simple background of the sky works better than the city.  It''s also nice that you included the jump (or whatever the termonology is) in there.  It adds a lot compared to cropping that out.  The photographers at the bottom also add a nice touch.  This seems kind of photojournalistic.', '2007-04-04 01:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517126, 492306, 65025, '<td valign="top">Nice repetition of figures.  Also there is a good sense of depth because.</td>', 'Nice repetition of figures.  Also there is a good sense of depth because.', '2007-04-04 02:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
