(3517290, 492603, 53316, '<td valign="top">Hm. I was wondering exactly how this portrayed fitness (it''s a nicely trim body but other areas like arms or stomach would show the theme better), except I then realized that very recently, since gaining weight, my lower back / "upper butt" area has gotten a bit too big for my tastes!!</td>', 'Hm. I was wondering exactly how this portrayed fitness (it''s a nicely trim body but other areas like arms or stomach would show the theme better), except I then realized that very recently, since gaining weight, my lower back / "upper butt" area has gotten a bit too big for my tastes!!', '2007-04-04 03:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517297, 492662, 53316, '<td valign="top">As someone with a medical condition where it sometimes can be a real struggle to walk not so far, this photo really inspires me.</td>', 'As someone with a medical condition where it sometimes can be a real struggle to walk not so far, this photo really inspires me.', '2007-04-04 03:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
