(3517365, 491484, 62637, '<td valign="top">great composition, but the processing is way over the top.</td>', 'great composition, but the processing is way over the top.', '2007-04-04 03:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517444, 490512, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot...Personally it does not do much for me...but in terms of quality of composition I could easily imagine this being used on a brochure for a gym</td>', 'Very interesting shot...Personally it does not do much for me...but in terms of quality of composition I could easily imagine this being used on a brochure for a gym', '2007-04-04 04:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517454, 490951, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...almost a great shot but I think it gets let down a touch in terms of rule of thirds.  The boat itself lies smack through the bottom third line but the head of the middle oarsman lies pretty much smack bang in the middle of the shot and the right hand oar of the third oarsman is kinda in no mans line.  Love the fact that you captured the splash of the oar but if this had been cropped so it hit one of the RoT cross points the composition would (imo) have been even better</td>', 'Nice shot...almost a great shot but I think it gets let down a touch in terms of rule of thirds.  The boat itself lies smack through the bottom third line but the head of the middle oarsman lies pretty much smack bang in the middle of the shot and the right hand oar of the third oarsman is kinda in no mans line.  Love the fact that you captured the splash of the oar but if this had been cropped so it hit one of the RoT cross points the composition would (imo) have been even better', '2007-04-04 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517462, 492670, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great idea well executed...just a thought...it may have fared even better if you had positioned the lighting so you only saw the shadow (which I think is fantastic) rather than the shadow and the girl...equally that may have allowed for the full shadow of the skipping rope to be captured<br/> <br/>Nice job though</td>', 'Great idea well executed...just a thought...it may have fared even better if you had positioned the lighting so you only saw the shadow (which I think is fantastic) rather than the shadow and the girl...equally that may have allowed for the full shadow of the skipping rope to be captured Nice job though', '2007-04-04 04:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517466, 490036, 68035, '<td valign="top">Sorry...its a nice shot but imo dnmc</td>', 'Sorry...its a nice shot but imo dnmc', '2007-04-04 04:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517470, 491484, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great shot...may have been even better without the boat in the background...still a stunning capture</td>', 'Great shot...may have been even better without the boat in the background...still a stunning capture', '2007-04-04 04:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3517479, 492544, 68035, '<td valign="top">Weird...bizarre and very very funny...You''ve also combined humour and a lovely crisp shot..good one.</td>', 'Weird...bizarre and very very funny...You''ve also combined humour and a lovely crisp shot..good one.', '2007-04-04 04:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
