(3517681, 492205, 53316, '<td valign="top">I originally did not like the tape running through the background but then I decided I did like it as it provided some good context; otherwise the background would look too much like a plain flat studio shot background, which doesn''t fit this picture.  I guess having the placement of the tape not directly on the bottom of the subjects would have been better but it is still okay. Great colors - very vibrant.</td>', 'I originally did not like the tape running through the background but then I decided I did like it as it provided some good context; otherwise the background would look too much like a plain flat studio shot background, which doesn''t fit this picture.  I guess having the placement of the tape not directly on the bottom of the subjects would have been better but it is still okay. Great colors - very vibrant.', '2007-04-04 05:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
