(3520542, 490248, 48968, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I would have taken a more aggressive approach with the hands - spread the fingers and squeeze, to add some athletic intensity to the image. The hands seem like they are cradling or caressing the ball, which, to me, doesn''t seem to fit. That''s pretty picky on my part, so take it for what it''s worth! Again, I like this image.</td>', 'Nice image. I would have taken a more aggressive approach with the hands - spread the fingers and squeeze, to add some athletic intensity to the image. The hands seem like they are cradling or caressing the ball, which, to me, doesn''t seem to fit. That''s pretty picky on my part, so take it for what it''s worth! Again, I like this image.', '2007-04-04 22:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
