(3520840, 492487, 74343, '<td valign="top">First off, your model has great definition and skin. You should use her again if opportunity presents itself. <br/> <br/>The print: I like the contrast, but I would''ve positioned the lighting in such a way that the outline of the bottom of her arm and sides of her torso didn''t blend in with the background. With a model with such great definition in her upper back, it would''ve been nice to see her arms and torso better.</td>', 'First off, your model has great definition and skin. You should use her again if opportunity presents itself.  The print: I like the contrast, but I would''ve positioned the lighting in such a way that the outline of the bottom of her arm and sides of her torso didn''t blend in with the background. With a model with such great definition in her upper back, it would''ve been nice to see her arms and torso better.', '2007-04-04 23:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
