(3522000, 492662, 74343, '<td valign="top">I love the way this was shot. The angle you chose makes the yellow road marker seem endless, and the hill gives you a sense of uncertainy of where the finish line is. Much like true endurance running.</td>', 'I love the way this was shot. The angle you chose makes the yellow road marker seem endless, and the hill gives you a sense of uncertainy of where the finish line is. Much like true endurance running.', '2007-04-05 11:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522010, 491938, 74343, '<td valign="top">The photo is a bit out of focus and there is a shadow line down the middle of his torso that really takes away from the photo. The blur and position of his arm leads me to believe that he''s jumping rope. If this is the case, it would have made for a better photo if you zoomed out more and caught the motion of his hands.</td>', 'The photo is a bit out of focus and there is a shadow line down the middle of his torso that really takes away from the photo. The blur and position of his arm leads me to believe that he''s jumping rope. If this is the case, it would have made for a better photo if you zoomed out more and caught the motion of his hands.', '2007-04-05 11:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
