(3522154, 491644, 72317, '<td valign="top">Oh man. More light and clarity would''ve gotten a ten from me. However, moving photos become unclear easily. That''s reasonable. Very nice image.</td>', 'Oh man. More light and clarity would''ve gotten a ten from me. However, moving photos become unclear easily. That''s reasonable. Very nice image.', '2007-04-05 12:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
