(3522217, 490578, 72317, '<td valign="top">I think most people consider fitness to mainly include physical activity, but I guess eating healthy keeps one fit as well. I like the simplicity and clarity of it, but there''s something about it that makes it look over-edited. A little too yellow on the stems and a little too indigo on the shadows. I guess maybe that isn''t your fault. It''s quite nice.</td>', 'I think most people consider fitness to mainly include physical activity, but I guess eating healthy keeps one fit as well. I like the simplicity and clarity of it, but there''s something about it that makes it look over-edited. A little too yellow on the stems and a little too indigo on the shadows. I guess maybe that isn''t your fault. It''s quite nice.', '2007-04-05 12:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
