(3522286, 492544, 35895, '<td valign="top">rofl, creative</td>', 'rofl, creative', '2007-04-05 13:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522317, 490693, 20124, '<td valign="top">Is this adorable cutie playing on a grass court? :-)<br/>As a tennis fan I may be a bit partial to this photo, but<br/>this really is well shot. Blurring of the background is good<br/>for DOF. Background also has no distracting objects to detract<br/>attention from the main points of interest, her face and racket.<br/> Photo isn''t lessened IMO by not showing the top tip of the racket.<br/>  Main flaw I see is the focus is a bit soft. Also add a bit more<br/>contrast.  overall, a 7.</td>', 'Is this adorable cutie playing on a grass court? :-)As a tennis fan I may be a bit partial to this photo, butthis really is well shot. Blurring of the background is goodfor DOF. Background also has no distracting objects to detractattention from the main points of interest, her face and racket. Photo isn''t lessened IMO by not showing the top tip of the racket.  Main flaw I see is the focus is a bit soft. Also add a bit morecontrast.  overall, a 7.', '2007-04-05 13:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522326, 492613, 20124, '<td valign="top">Fitness for using dumbbells,  as I use them myself. But vanity<br/>for taking a photo of oneself  using said dumbbells. :-)<br/>  Okay, that was jealousy. My arms don''t look that great yet.<br/> <br/>    IMO the dumbbell on the left side of the photo is distracting.<br/>And also the lighting is a bit dark. Generally being on the dark<br/>side is good to show definition of the arm, but having it a bit<br/>brighter, will still show definition. B&amp;W is an interesting choice.<br/>Not bad or good. Color could have worked as well.  I gave this a 6.</td>', 'Fitness for using dumbbells,  as I use them myself. But vanityfor taking a photo of oneself  using said dumbbells. :-)  Okay, that was jealousy. My arms don''t look that great yet.     IMO the dumbbell on the left side of the photo is distracting.And also the lighting is a bit dark. Generally being on the darkside is good to show definition of the arm, but having it a bitbrighter, will still show definition. B&W is an interesting choice.Not bad or good. Color could have worked as well.  I gave this a 6.', '2007-04-05 13:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522339, 490048, 20124, '<td valign="top">How does this show fitness. Technically well shot though.</td>', 'How does this show fitness. Technically well shot though.', '2007-04-05 13:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522342, 492317, 20124, '<td valign="top">Showing at least a small part of the bike would score better</td>', 'Showing at least a small part of the bike would score better', '2007-04-05 13:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522351, 491261, 20124, '<td valign="top">contortionists are amazing, but face here is blurry.</td>', 'contortionists are amazing, but face here is blurry.', '2007-04-05 13:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522363, 492570, 20124, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. I''m sure you decided that the main POI are the mountains<br/>as they are more clearly shot than the soft focus of the kayak and it''s rider.<br/>  Tough decision, but IMO it was the right one.<br/> Certainly fits the challenge theme as well. An eight.</td>', 'Awesome shot. I''m sure you decided that the main POI are the mountainsas they are more clearly shot than the soft focus of the kayak and it''s rider.  Tough decision, but IMO it was the right one. Certainly fits the challenge theme as well. An eight.', '2007-04-05 14:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522375, 492544, 20124, '<td valign="top">A clever take on the challenge theme. And an interesting perspective<br/>with the use of a mirror of a car.  Title is great. And the lighting<br/>is fine. Houses in the back are fine, not distractions, as it shows<br/>the suburban neighborhood environment.  Very original. A nine.</td>', 'A clever take on the challenge theme. And an interesting perspectivewith the use of a mirror of a car.  Title is great. And the lightingis fine. Houses in the back are fine, not distractions, as it showsthe suburban neighborhood environment.  Very original. A nine.', '2007-04-05 14:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522379, 492264, 20124, '<td valign="top">How many left arm shots am I going to see on this challenge? :-)</td>', 'How many left arm shots am I going to see on this challenge? :-)', '2007-04-05 14:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522399, 492672, 20124, '<td valign="top">A boxer''s physique. Welterweight perhaps? That''s 147 lbs. for you<br/>non followers of the sweet science.<br/> <br/>   Lighting is a bit dark, but does fit the character of the composition,<br/>as it shows off strength. Although, if we can see more of the eyes,<br/>it might score better.<br/> I like the symmetry of this. Totally centered.<br/>This shows that there are exceptions<br/>to applying the  rule of thirds. Seven<br/>A seven.</td>', 'A boxer''s physique. Welterweight perhaps? That''s 147 lbs. for younon followers of the sweet science.    Lighting is a bit dark, but does fit the character of the composition,as it shows off strength. Although, if we can see more of the eyes,it might score better. I like the symmetry of this. Totally centered.This shows that there are exceptionsto applying the  rule of thirds. SevenA seven.', '2007-04-05 14:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522411, 492586, 20124, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. Definitely fits the challenge.<br/>And does look fun, albeit a bit scary.<br/>Technically, the natural lighting, the focus, and the contrast and<br/>colors are all fine. Good job! A nine.</td>', 'Great action shot. Definitely fits the challenge.And does look fun, albeit a bit scary.Technically, the natural lighting, the focus, and the contrast andcolors are all fine. Good job! A nine.', '2007-04-05 14:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522417, 490578, 20124, '<td valign="top">Does not fit challenge at all<br/>And lighting is way too bright.</td>', 'Does not fit challenge at allAnd lighting is way too bright.', '2007-04-05 14:26:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3522434, 491209, 20124, '<td valign="top">I like this. Mostly because I have neither the fitness level nor the<br/>bravery to even attempt. But does look kind of fun, in a death<br/>defying sort of way.<br/> <br/>   Technically, the focus seems a bit softer on the climber than<br/>the mountain. IMO it should be the other way around.<br/> Normally the rule of closeups on people is good to follow, but<br/>here, to show how high up he is, it might be better to pan out<br/>a bit. To show more mountain below him. Seven</td>', 'I like this. Mostly because I have neither the fitness level nor thebravery to even attempt. But does look kind of fun, in a deathdefying sort of way.    Technically, the focus seems a bit softer on the climber thanthe mountain. IMO it should be the other way around. Normally the rule of closeups on people is good to follow, buthere, to show how high up he is, it might be better to pan outa bit. To show more mountain below him. Seven', '2007-04-05 14:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522435, 490036, 6888, '<td valign="top">unknown to me how this fits the challenge</td>', 'unknown to me how this fits the challenge', '2007-04-05 14:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522456, 492192, 61961, '<td valign="top">This is simple but effective.  Good depth of field, fits the challenge well.  I think I''d like it even better without the thick frame.</td>', 'This is simple but effective.  Good depth of field, fits the challenge well.  I think I''d like it even better without the thick frame.', '2007-04-05 14:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522459, 492205, 20124, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. Fits challenge well. And compositionally I like<br/>how the action is centered on top of a plain red background, which is <br/>contrasted well with the blue and white uniformed combatants.<br/>You can also see the how challenging this physical tussle is, by the<br/>expression and sweat on one of the two combatant''s face.<br/>   A 9.</td>', 'Great action shot. Fits challenge well. And compositionally I likehow the action is centered on top of a plain red background, which is contrasted well with the blue and white uniformed combatants.You can also see the how challenging this physical tussle is, by theexpression and sweat on one of the two combatant''s face.   A 9.', '2007-04-05 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522462, 492491, 61961, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, fits the challenge and then some.  High score from me -- no points off for silly caption. ;-)</td>', 'Great lighting, fits the challenge and then some.  High score from me -- no points off for silly caption. ;-)', '2007-04-05 14:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522470, 492479, 61961, '<td valign="top">I gave this one a high score.  Really says "fitness" to me.  The b&amp;w is very well done (so often it just seems like a ploy to rescue a bad photo, but not in this case).</td>', 'I gave this one a high score.  Really says "fitness" to me.  The b&w is very well done (so often it just seems like a ploy to rescue a bad photo, but not in this case).', '2007-04-05 14:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522483, 492306, 56931, '<td valign="top">like the composition but needs a litle bit of movement</td>', 'like the composition but needs a litle bit of movement', '2007-04-05 14:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
