(3525020, 491938, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but with the slow shutter speed there''s some blurring which, for me, just kills the shot.</td>', 'Nice shot but with the slow shutter speed there''s some blurring which, for me, just kills the shot.', '2007-04-06 12:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
