(3525278, 491834, 73818, '<td valign="top">beautiful pose, it''s not so easy to do (imagine that). The shape the gymnists made is perfect and the colour contrast look wouderful, the eye make up is a nice touch.  The one thing i don''t like (though i don''t think you could have any control over it) was to have both girls with their hair up or both down...that''s just a personal thing though.  really well done.</td>', 'beautiful pose, it''s not so easy to do (imagine that). The shape the gymnists made is perfect and the colour contrast look wouderful, the eye make up is a nice touch.  The one thing i don''t like (though i don''t think you could have any control over it) was to have both girls with their hair up or both down...that''s just a personal thing though.  really well done.', '2007-04-06 14:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
