(3534965, 492697, 76731, '<td valign="top">For me... there are way too many things to look at in the shot...nothing really holds your attention. I know of course it is a bike race or the beginning of one. It is just hard to find a focal point. Maybe a little sharpening and a curves boost would give the image more punch. Just some thoughts...<br/> <br/>Hatch</td>', 'For me... there are way too many things to look at in the shot...nothing really holds your attention. I know of course it is a bike race or the beginning of one. It is just hard to find a focal point. Maybe a little sharpening and a curves boost would give the image more punch. Just some thoughts... Hatch', '2007-04-10 04:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3534968, 491971, 76731, '<td valign="top">I have to be honest... this doesn''t strike me as a fitness photo. Maybe it would fall in to the category of a journalism style shot...covering the life of a skater or something along those lines. The lighting isn''t bad and the image is pretty sharp. Again... not really fitness IMO.<br/> <br/>Hatch</td>', 'I have to be honest... this doesn''t strike me as a fitness photo. Maybe it would fall in to the category of a journalism style shot...covering the life of a skater or something along those lines. The lighting isn''t bad and the image is pretty sharp. Again... not really fitness IMO. Hatch', '2007-04-10 04:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
