(3535516, 491860, 56828, '<td valign="top">What can you say that isn''t amazing about this photo???  Besides the fact that you have a great sharp image of a snowboarding higher than clouds in the sky....teh back ground really adds too it.  The background is faded enough that it keeps all focus on the snowboarder.  Your subject colors and contrast are just amazing...and I can even see the snow falling from his snowboard.  By far the best photo in the group....10</td>', 'What can you say that isn''t amazing about this photo???  Besides the fact that you have a great sharp image of a snowboarding higher than clouds in the sky....teh back ground really adds too it.  The background is faded enough that it keeps all focus on the snowboarder.  Your subject colors and contrast are just amazing...and I can even see the snow falling from his snowboard.  By far the best photo in the group....10', '2007-04-10 12:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535518, 491882, 56828, '<td valign="top">I''m sure your comments are telling you that you need to straighten the horizon.  Your subject could be more sharp also.</td>', 'I''m sure your comments are telling you that you need to straighten the horizon.  Your subject could be more sharp also.', '2007-04-10 12:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535519, 492264, 56828, '<td valign="top">Could use a better background...or even darkened the background.  A wider view of the arm would have also helped.</td>', 'Could use a better background...or even darkened the background.  A wider view of the arm would have also helped.', '2007-04-10 12:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535522, 490512, 56828, '<td valign="top">The oversaturation completely loses alot of details.  I can''t even see what the person is doing.  I think the black and white would have greatly added to your photo had it not been for hte oversaturation and the blur.</td>', 'The oversaturation completely loses alot of details.  I can''t even see what the person is doing.  I think the black and white would have greatly added to your photo had it not been for hte oversaturation and the blur.', '2007-04-10 12:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535537, 491860, 66497, '<td valign="top">excellent capture</td>', 'excellent capture', '2007-04-10 12:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535550, 491060, 66497, '<td valign="top">O boy Cornell lwt 8 perhaps? lets see... 5 seat should keep his outside elbow up and keep his eyes in the boat. Bow needs to watch his elbows too. Also, four seat needs to get in time with six seat, he is a little early. <br/> <br/>However, those things are not your fault :P. If you were their coach I''d be upset. You capture the pain in their bodies and faces really well. Would be cool if there was some kind of background, ie. seeing a boat house, city skyline..... 9</td>', 'O boy Cornell lwt 8 perhaps? lets see... 5 seat should keep his outside elbow up and keep his eyes in the boat. Bow needs to watch his elbows too. Also, four seat needs to get in time with six seat, he is a little early.  However, those things are not your fault :P. If you were their coach I''d be upset. You capture the pain in their bodies and faces really well. Would be cool if there was some kind of background, ie. seeing a boat house, city skyline..... 9', '2007-04-10 12:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
