(3535772, 491209, 19311, '<td valign="top">I really love the colors and angle of this shot.  The one thing that may have helped it was to find a moment where you can see the climbers face, ideally with a cool expression.  Still though very nice.</td>', 'I really love the colors and angle of this shot.  The one thing that may have helped it was to find a moment where you can see the climbers face, ideally with a cool expression.  Still though very nice.', '2007-04-10 14:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
