(3535784, 492342, 19311, '<td valign="top">With images like this, you always want to have the subjects face, not the back of her head.  This would enable you to see how hard she is really pulling.</td>', 'With images like this, you always want to have the subjects face, not the back of her head.  This would enable you to see how hard she is really pulling.', '2007-04-10 14:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
