(3535844, 490036, 19311, '<td valign="top">Take some time to read the tutorial on how to prepare images for dpchallenge so you have them at maximum size.  Next time try to take a picture that is somewhat relevant to the challenge.  A sitting squirrel doesn''t say fitness to me in any way.  Better luck next time</td>', 'Take some time to read the tutorial on how to prepare images for dpchallenge so you have them at maximum size.  Next time try to take a picture that is somewhat relevant to the challenge.  A sitting squirrel doesn''t say fitness to me in any way.  Better luck next time', '2007-04-10 14:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
