(3537548, 491209, 72037, '<td valign="top">I was firmly on the ground!  The climber was in the Garden of the Gods city park in Colorado Springs, CO.  I have no idea what the rating was, however, the climbers belay had a climbing book in her had trying to explain to the climber the route to take.  This is a VERY popular climbing area and look forward to returning for more pics.</td>', 'I was firmly on the ground!  The climber was in the Garden of the Gods city park in Colorado Springs, CO.  I have no idea what the rating was, however, the climbers belay had a climbing book in her had trying to explain to the climber the route to take.  This is a VERY popular climbing area and look forward to returning for more pics.', '2007-04-11 02:12:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3537678, 490036, 70484, '<td valign="top">This little guy is so cute. What does khis mean? I thought it may be a yoga pose or something, which would make this funny. <br/> <br/>Don''t worry about the low score, we all start somewhere. Keep at it and listen to the constructive comments. I am learning so much from everyone on this site. Just keep entering and learning.</td>', 'This little guy is so cute. What does khis mean? I thought it may be a yoga pose or something, which would make this funny.  Don''t worry about the low score, we all start somewhere. Keep at it and listen to the constructive comments. I am learning so much from everyone on this site. Just keep entering and learning.', '2007-04-11 03:06:34.000000', NULL, 0),
