(3538238, 491761, 10047, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snaffles:</b></div><hr/><i> wow, glad I''m NOT in that scrum!  Great action capture. 8 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m glad I wasn''t in that game also. Toledo recently graduated to Division 2 rugby and the opponents are just bigger and tougher. The Celtics always offer me some match time, but its usually B-side, and I usually decline because I can''t keep up with them younguns. There is an Old Boys match against Detroit in May I''m thinking about getting in shape for, but I''ll have to verify that they''ll have Oxygen and paddles on the touchlines. Thanks for the comment.</td>', 'Originally posted by snaffles: wow, glad I''m NOT in that scrum!  Great action capture. 8   I''m glad I wasn''t in that game also. Toledo recently graduated to Division 2 rugby and the opponents are just bigger and tougher. The Celtics always offer me some match time, but its usually B-side, and I usually decline because I can''t keep up with them younguns. There is an Old Boys match against Detroit in May I''m thinking about getting in shape for, but I''ll have to verify that they''ll have Oxygen and paddles on the touchlines. Thanks for the comment.', '2007-04-11 08:46:59.000000', NULL, 0),
